  "content": {
    "state": [
      {
        "id": "state/car-at-floor",
        "scope": "party",
        "initial": 1,
        "note": "Which landing the ONE car occupies. There is exactly one car and it exists at exactly one floor at a time, so this datum is the whole of the lift's position."
      },
      {
        "id": "state/ride-in-progress",
        "scope": "party",
        "initial": 0,
        "note": "1 from the first tick of a ride to its last. Every control is gated on it being 0, which is how `a pull during a ride is ignored, not queued` (planner ruling) is expressed: the tick line's guard is false, and the interaction record is discarded unconditionally on the same tick, so nothing survives to be replayed."
      },
      {
        "id": "state/embers",
        "scope": "player",
        "initial": 5,
        "name": "Embers",
        "note": "The wager. Player-scoped, so a death costs the player who died and nobody else."
      }
    ],
